            {
              "uuid": "d40ff28faf304d919a9723003f8a6a2f",
              "side": "right",
              "linkColor": "#3A8DDF",
              "title": "<p>​GDP = 消费 + 投资 + 净出口（可以理解为投资的一种）</p>",
              "content": "",
              "children": null,
              "folded": 0,
              "link": ""
            },
            {
              "uuid": "76fcf7cfa0ca4a8cb4ad58d00cb2d6a7",
              "side": "right",
              "linkColor": "#E08370",
              "title": "<p>​极端高的储蓄率</p>",
              "content": "",
              "children": [
                {
                  "uuid": "9b80c906a0a447b49f2bdc17aeb1b012",
                  "side": "right",
                  "linkColor": "",
                  "title": "<p>​也就是消费极低，要么放弃gdp目标，大家一起躺平呗，不发展了</p>",
                  "content": "",
                  "children": null,
                  "folded": 0,
                  "link": ""
                },
                {
                  "uuid": "db394761465d40168a1ffd1b1438f3f9",
                  "side": "right",
                  "linkColor": "",
                  "title": "<p>​要经济增长，只能发力投资</p>",
                  "content": "",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "uuid": "7dba13abb799487c97b7c6b364f4c226",
                      "side": "right",
                      "linkColor": "",
                      "title": "<p>​过去十几年天量的基础建设投资</p>",
                      "content": "",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "uuid": "148c824e05a04f9c81577136edc5a5c1",
                          "side": "right",
                          "linkColor": "",
                          "title": "<p>​问题</p>",
                          "content": "",
                          "folded": 0,
                          "link": "",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "uuid": "cfedab48750f4a6594fbaab06633ceb8",
                              "side": "right",
                              "linkColor": "",
                              "title": "<p>​基础建设成本非常的高，中国的基础建设标准已经媲美甚至超越发达国家</p>",
                              "content": "",
                              "children": null,
                              "folded": 0,
                              "link": ""
                            },
                            {
                              "uuid": "c84b935c81fe4f298cbedfaeb0c956b2",
                              "side": "right",
                              "linkColor": "",
                              "title": "<p>所以投资收益很低，甚至对于绝大多数的基础建设投资就是负资产，不仅不会产生收益，还需要消耗大量的资金去维护</p>",
                              "content": "",
                              "children": null,
                              "folded": 0,
                              "link": ""
                            },
                            {
                              "uuid": "6f095900d36c4d9c91380ae84cad86d2",
                              "side": "right",
                              "linkColor": "",
                              "title": "<p>​结果就是 一留下了巨额的基础建设债务，和大量荒废的基建</p>",
                              "content": "",
                              "children": null,
                              "folded": 0,
                              "link": ""
                            },
                            {
                              "uuid": "1395027f28004dda97e5fc85916b41ae",
                              "side": "right",
                              "linkColor": "",
                              "title": "<p>​其实即使是投资到长三角珠三角，收益会好很多，但是也不行，容纳不了这么大的投资，一个简单的估算，广东每年转移支付七千亿，算留下一半，三千亿，十年就是三万亿，地铁一公里十亿，可以三千公里，是广深目前的加起来的两倍多。高铁一公里两亿。所以这些钱足够把珠三角修到地铁全覆盖都够了</p>",
                              "content": "",
                              "children": null,
                              "folded": 0,
                              "link": ""
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ],
                      "folded": 0,
                      "link": ""
                    },
                    {
                      "uuid": "abf0b908ab5243af8ea9ed433562e453",
                      "side": "right",
                      "linkColor": "",
                      "title": "<p>​各地政府竞相上制造业产能</p>",
                      "content": "",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "uuid": "a2ec46f8a4384d44a81d4ff1a3b13b1f",
                          "side": "right",
                          "linkColor": "",
                          "title": "<p>​离谱的产能过剩</p>",
                          "content": "",
                          "children": null,
                          "folded": 0,
                          "link": ""
                        },
                        {
                          "uuid": "1c8eff301a6a437e8d451d73b5095d51",
                          "side": "right",
                          "linkColor": "",
                          "title": "<p>高盛的报告，中国的光伏等产业就算供给全世界都是几倍的过剩</p>",
                          "content": "",
                          "children": null,
                          "folded": 0,
                          "link": ""
                        },
                        {
                          "uuid": "ed747de50984426398183bf7058f634d",
                          "side": "right",
                          "linkColor": "",
                          "title": "<p>​一些数据</p>",
                          "content": "",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "uuid": "ff254a66056a4fa58b7416185177957b",
                              "side": "right",
                              "linkColor": "",
                              "title": "<p>​中国钢铁产能是全世界的一半</p>",
                              "content": "",
                              "children": null,
                              "folded": 0,
                              "link": ""
                            },
                            {
                              "uuid": "ec19d9db3808478084912dd8a301620d",
                              "side": "right",
                              "linkColor": "",
                              "title": "<p>​光伏板卖到欧洲比栅栏都便宜</p>",
                              "content": "",
                              "children": null,
                              "folded": 0,
                              "link": ""
                            },
                            {
                              "uuid": "cd15baf0f08a4809a774157ff89dfd8d",
                              "side": "right",
                              "linkColor": "",
                              "title": "<p>​今年亏损企业占比30%+</p>",
                              "content": "",
                              "children": null,
                              "folded": 0,
                              "link": ""
                            }
                          ],
                          "folded": 0,
                          "link": ""
                        }
                      ],
                      "folded": 0,
                      "link": ""
                    },
                    {
                      "uuid": "6ba9f002bfd74d1888a95bdbbed259a3",
                      "side": "right",
                      "linkColor": "",
                      "title": "<p>​总结</p>",
                      "content": "",
                      "folded": 0,
                      "link": "",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "uuid": "7dc494b3c4bc473e8b06ee128e3bd6f7",
                          "side": "right",
                          "linkColor": "",
                          "title": "<p>​投基础建设，没回报</p>",
                          "content": "",
                          "children": null,
                          "folded": 0,
                          "link": ""
                        },
                        {
                          "uuid": "c49255f1d51c4449b8e81903b9ead011",
                          "side": "right",
                          "linkColor": "",
                          "title": "<p>​投工业产能，过剩，也没回报</p>",
                          "content": "",
                          "children": null,
                          "folded": 0,
                          "link": ""
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "uuid": "d1d441da0d064319b660f95ec68881ae",
                      "side": "right",
                      "linkColor": "",
                      "title": "<p>​目前政府的方案</p>",
                      "content": "",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "uuid": "32f9a363fc3849818a305d710bf5b033",
                          "side": "right",
                          "linkColor": "",
                          "title": "<p>​既然债务很大，那么就还债呗</p>",
                          "content": "",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "uuid": "59ecf3dd84e04730ac4643a310b391b7",
                              "side": "right",
                              "linkColor": "",
                              "title": "<p>问题是政府大力投资的工业都不赚钱啊，只能靠政府给的廉价资金续命</p>",
                              "content": "",
                              "children": null,
                              "folded": 0,
                              "link": ""
                            }
                          ],
                          "folded": 0,
                          "link": ""
                        },
                        {
                          "uuid": "d745d325e18748e092d344396516cab3",
                          "side": "right",
                          "linkColor": "",
                          "title": "<p>​投资新的生产力</p>",
                          "content": "",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "uuid": "c43a5219e144438ab457087637f88289",
                              "side": "right",
                              "linkColor": "",
                              "title": "<p>​目前还没过剩，还有利润，可以缓口气</p>",
                              "content": "",
                              "children": null,
                              "folded": 0,
                              "link": ""
                            },
                            {
                              "uuid": "521c4aa444e6453eb8f7cedcf0f3f846",
                              "side": "right",
                              "linkColor": "",
                              "title": "<p>​问题1</p>",
                              "content": "",
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "uuid": "8cc3adc2e5454d5f9bf9e2587859123f",
                                  "side": "",
                                  "linkColor": "",
                                  "title": "<p>中国的储蓄太多了，只要突破就立马是产能过剩</p>",
                                  "content": "",
                                  "children": null,
                                  "folded": 0,
                                  "link": ""
                                },
                                {
                                  "uuid": "319a0880d57b4abf98f4bb62d0ff81ad",
                                  "side": "right",
                                  "linkColor": "",
                                  "title": "<p>​比如前几年的新能源电池，新能源车，这才三四年就开始打价格战了，进入过剩阶段了</p>",
                                  "content": "",
                                  "children": null,
                                  "folded": 0,
                                  "link": ""
                                }
                              ],
                              "folded": 0,
                              "link": ""
                            },
                            {
                              "uuid": "13d58f78bfa84d469c562a63ea73033e",
                              "side": "right",
                              "linkColor": "",
                              "title": "<p>​问题2</p>",
                              "content": "",
                              "folded": 0,
                              "link": "",
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "uuid": "65f53dc31fd547c497faf8eb5eb492ec",
                                  "side": "right",
                                  "linkColor": "",
                                  "title": "<p>还能有利润，是因为其他国家生产的不多，还能赚钱，还能消费的起</p>",
                                  "content": "",
                                  "children": null,
                                  "folded": 0,
                                  "link": ""
                                },
                                {
                                  "uuid": "0cd5dc296cbb4e9e9736b0ef8cd71566",
                                  "side": "right",
                                  "linkColor": "",
                                  "title": "<p>​你卷起来了，大家都不赚钱，甚至本国的就业都被你抢了</p>",
                                  "content": "",
                                  "children": null,
                                  "folded": 0,
                                  "link": ""
                                },
                                {
                                  "uuid": "30da789c746d405894a23bc993763e3a",
                                  "side": "right",
                                  "linkColor": "",
                                  "title": "<p>​那就是贸易战呗</p>",
                                  "content": "",
                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "uuid": "afefa2c5aff445efba558fa238c03b93",
                                      "side": "right",
                                      "linkColor": "",
                                      "title": "<p>​欧洲给中国电动车加关税</p>",
                                      "content": "",
                                      "children": null,
                                      "folded": 0,
                                      "link": ""
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "uuid": "e66c16886e5741a6abe94f97ebc369f4",
                                      "side": "right",
                                      "linkColor": "",
                                      "title": "<p>​甚至连菲律宾都要给中国纺织产品加关税</p>",
                                      "content": "",
                                      "children": null,
                                      "folded": 0,
                                      "link": ""
                                    }
                                  ],
                                  "folded": 0,
                                  "link": ""
                                },
                                {
                                  "uuid": "6e7e0057e2dd4552aea9ad5e8759ef5d",
                                  "side": "right",
                                  "linkColor": "",
                                  "title": "<p>​到这里，应该明白，还是得提高本国消费力，降低生产力，达到一种平衡</p>",
                                  "content": "",
                                  "children": null,
                                  "folded": 0,
                                  "link": ""
                                },
                                {
                                  "uuid": "3c367e576cb74071a8451d93958175e2",
                                  "side": "right",
                                  "linkColor": "",
                                  "title": "<p>但是由于各位的选择是</p>",
                                  "content": "",
                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "uuid": "0e65aeafa7a440509ecea3f61359fca1",
                                      "side": "right",
                                      "linkColor": "",
                                      "title": "<p>​继续缩减消费</p>",
                                      "content": "",
                                      "children": [
                                        {
                                          "uuid": "ca55df6bb572424fa36822bce5cc4085",
                                          "side": "right",
                                          "linkColor": "",
                                          "title": "<p>​企业进一步赚不到钱</p>",
                                          "content": "",
                                          "children": null,
                                          "folded": 0,
                                          "link": ""
                                        }
                                      ],
                                      "folded": 0,
                                      "link": ""
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "uuid": "1c8bcec5560448c3adda728f142d00a4",
                                      "side": "right",
                                      "linkColor": "",
                                      "title": "<p>​继续选择加班生产</p>",
                                      "content": "",
                                      "children": [
                                        {
                                          "uuid": "112e5cca359747bb86381f6aad0e4279",
                                          "side": "right",
                                          "linkColor": "",
                                          "title": "<p>​叠加生产力提高，单个人生产的更多</p>",
                                          "content": "",
                                          "children": null,
                                          "folded": 0,
                                          "link": ""
                                        }
                                      ],
                                      "folded": 0,
                                      "link": ""
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "uuid": "4637a716c1fe4477afcc24e59ded9d6b",
                                      "side": "right",
                                      "linkColor": "",
                                      "title": "<p>​那么只能裁员了，不需要这么多人</p>",
                                      "content": "",
                                      "children": null,
                                      "folded": 0,
                                      "link": ""
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "uuid": "fe56395593b948b4bf78b78767a907f7",
                                      "side": "right",
                                      "linkColor": "",
                                      "title": "<p>​上述循环加剧，企业进一步不赚钱，进一步裁员，打工人进一步缩减开支，进入大萧条</p>",
                                      "content": "",
