                              "side": "right",
                              "linkColor": "",
                              "title": "<p>​按照一个月一千，补贴三年，一年一千万小孩，对应到财政也就三千亿</p>",
                              "content": "",
                              "children": null,
                              "folded": 0,
                              "link": ""
                            }
                          ],
                          "folded": 0,
                          "link": ""
                        },
                        {
                          "uuid": "643eb8895fd54bfb8717a90cbd535eeb",
                          "side": "right",
                          "linkColor": "",
                          "title": "<p>​农村老人补贴</p>",
                          "content": "",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "uuid": "429a99e2ab654b0a8c84b1c5a0b1ecd9",
                              "side": "right",
                              "linkColor": "",
                              "title": "<p>​新农合一个月一百多块</p>",
                              "content": "",
                              "children": null,
                              "folded": 0,
                              "link": ""
                            },
                            {
                              "uuid": "85fec875e44445b1bb9b41cb268966f5",
                              "side": "right",
                              "linkColor": "",
                              "title": "<p>​按照一亿老人，给他们翻倍，一年增加一千多亿的支出，比基建便宜多了</p>",
                              "content": "",
                              "children": null,
                              "folded": 0,
                              "link": ""
                            }
                          ],
                          "folded": 0,
                          "link": ""
                        },
                        {
                          "uuid": "5ad245df464540fc8e1a6b5100abe742",
                          "side": "right",
                          "linkColor": "",
                          "title": "<p>​放开落户</p>",
                          "content": "",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "uuid": "aef57ef1552d4a4ba5c765319693f80b",
                              "side": "right",
                              "linkColor": "",
                              "title": "<p>​这个重庆市长说的</p>",
                              "content": "",
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "uuid": "11347015c4524efd860820ce9b753f39",
                                  "side": "right",
                                  "linkColor": "",
                                  "title": "<p>​农民工由于职业生命周期很短，大概就二十年，创造的价值远小于落户的市民</p>",
                                  "content": "",
                                  "children": null,
                                  "folded": 0,
                                  "link": ""
                                }
                              ],
                              "folded": 0,
                              "link": ""
                            },
                            {
                              "uuid": "3fd0b8fe87c94d7dad96a7b33912e9dc",
                              "side": "right",
                              "linkColor": "",
                              "title": "<p>​其实上面很好理解，落户后</p>",
                              "content": "",
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "uuid": "0e30ba5631f94ffab92097e9f759b65d",
                                  "side": "",
                                  "linkColor": "",
                                  "title": "<p>政府可以投资教育住房医疗等等， 投资增加了</p>",
                                  "content": "",
                                  "children": null,
                                  "folded": 0,
                                  "link": ""
                                },
                                {
                                  "uuid": "6661b49c2e954e4f92dba76cd02fd2fd",
                                  "side": "",
                                  "linkColor": "",
                                  "title": "<p>​农民工本身的消费增加了，而不是回到老家建设了一堆没人住的房子， 消费增加了</p>",
                                  "content": "",
                                  "children": null,
                                  "folded": 0,
                                  "link": ""
                                },
                                {
                                  "uuid": "b24dfc7515f04fb18c8e23a731677037",
                                  "side": "",
                                  "linkColor": "",
                                  "title": "<p>​农民工老了，四五十岁一般就会返乡不出来了，但是一般的打工人是五六十岁的，职业寿命增加了</p>",
                                  "content": "",
